1.13.0 Release notes (2026-09-23)
================================

Improvements to the 'RingPublishingTracking' module.

### Changes

* Added IS (session identifier) field to every tracking event
* Extended RDLC field with variant.external custom parameters
* Added content view type to RDLC for content page view events
* Made content keep-alive data source optional when reporting content page views
* Added SQ (sequence) field to every tracking event
* 'segmentId' field of 'AureusEventContext' is now nullable
    - passing null omits the 'segment_id' key from the reported event instead of sending an empty value
* Added public method 'updateApplicationAdvertisementSite' to change the advertisement site at runtime
* Effective page view event is now reported also when content keep-alive tracking is not active
* Fixed duplicate event sends caused by overlapping flush concurrency
